  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Subnet.Interaction.InspectableObject
  inspectionId: RedSignal
  firstInspection:
  - 'A red signal light. It whispers: ''What if you''re going the wrong way? What
    if there is no right way?'''
  - '* ...It''s a light. Lights don''t whisper.'
  - 'It whispers: ''Says you.'''
  repeatInspection:
  - It's still red. It's always red. That's kind of its whole thing.
